; LSI Logic Fusion-MPT SAS miniport driver (demand start: the boot loader loads it when the Critical Device Database names it for a device that is present, so Setup and every boot find SAS1068 disks)
[AddReg]
HKLM,"SYSTEM\CurrentControlSet\Services\mptsas","ErrorControl",0x00010001,0x00000001
HKLM,"SYSTEM\CurrentControlSet\Services\mptsas","Group",0x00000000,"SCSI Miniport"
HKLM,"SYSTEM\CurrentControlSet\Services\mptsas","ImagePath",0x00020000,"system32\drivers\mptsas.sys"
HKLM,"SYSTEM\CurrentControlSet\Services\mptsas","Start",0x00010001,0x00000003
HKLM,"SYSTEM\CurrentControlSet\Services\mptsas","Type",0x00010001,0x00000001
